<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian and Lebanese officials met in Damascus to discuss border security and refugee management, while Iraq and Syria negotiated oil exports via the Banias pipeline and Syria weighed joining a Saudi-Turkey-Pakistan defence pact. Hezbollah-nominated minister’s visit to Syria was described as a political signal, and Greek Orthodox Christians faced growing threats in Syria and Jordan. Kurdish refugees from Sarkani reported insecurity after an attack on a return convoy, and Syrian rebels shelled from Turkish-controlled territory. Syrian intelligence foiled a terrorist plot targeting the Homs refinery and Israeli strikes hit southern Syria, resulting in civilian casualties. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQV21ETHRsUXR5U0FReVRrTjZlYnJzMGRVSC1XdzlybGl1aTR5SzI1OHpZX1lhQWVpNFA5enFMTXBzbHgzQWpqYUZsX3lVUHRiWEJIQkwzbk5xTVpvQ29zdXRjTGI3em5tdEVaYWhsNXlXY0dURnQ2ODRzaEZMaGlJV3hQVkRoUm1nRlZobmNDZFd0d3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Military Watch Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxOZjZrbWVIdjBqVm9lRmhxUFhVTktITEVPYjhlQXljRHpUbWNqMTlyV0lhaHZFT2w5M3FCNEF0d1BmZkU2aFZsTVU1UG5QanNQdjhlZW0zcDRTbGc5Z3JUTHppbEpHQlIxUERDblRsUGs0eTMtMS14cUF4OURyTUJpVERNUTAyUVFvZGl2RXk2Um5zSUJ5bzc0SktBbktqUnkzc2JmY3lBSWhIWWVYMlo1ck5jYmMycjZTa3ZtSnV6ZFJLeE8tVkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Media Line&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPV2dMa1VybnpsRlhYS0JmMEZkT1ZFNTVnaUNsM2x1WjE2OUNrX3RCWlZyTWNaZWM3Ql9hemZ0cFVaTG1wTnlCWS1ObEQ5VXF4cWhqTGNLak1PZEk3dlRDc0VrUzd2cW9Ga1ZJbnp4OFp4MXRkV2dNVFg5N0JvMFFyVEtCbUl2cjJmaXdaRTJDVDJRc3hMbFAySVU1cjRQWHY3MTQ3cDNrWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPeVM0R2hVZDV1QnE5Q3gyLTlM